  "id": "https://samsm.ch/campus-lights-updates/",
  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Campus Lights Updates and Out-takes",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eIt\u0026rsquo;s 5 months since I posted my project \u003ca href=\"/campus-lights/\"\u003eCampus Lights\u003c/a\u003e.\nSadly I didn\u0026rsquo;t manage to make any progress with getting anything changed on\ncampus, the person I\u0026rsquo;d emailed didn\u0026rsquo;t get back to me and my exams \u0026amp; dissertation\ntook precedence so I didn\u0026rsquo;t pursue it any further.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eIt\u0026rsquo;s 5 months since I posted my project \u003ca href=\"/campus-lights/\"\u003eCampus Lights\u003c/a\u003e.\nSadly I didn\u0026rsquo;t manage to make any progress with getting anything changed on\ncampus, the person I\u0026rsquo;d emailed didn\u0026rsquo;t get back to me and my exams \u0026amp; dissertation\ntook precedence so I didn\u0026rsquo;t pursue it any further.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI did manage to write a slightly extended version of the article for\n\u003ca href=\"https://emulsive.org/articles/campus-lights-documenting-local-light-pollution-on-film\"\u003eEmulsive\u003c/a\u003e,\nfor which I also swapped out a couple of photos. I consider this to be the final\nversion of the project and I am very happy with how it turned out.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso reddit user \u003ca href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/ISUOnFilm\"\u003eISUOnFilm\u003c/a\u003e created\n\u003ca href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/AnalogCommunity/comments/axqfab/campus_lights_2_my_version_of_a_project_by/\"\u003etheir own version\u003c/a\u003e\nof the project which I think turned out really well.\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.flickr.com/gp/ss9679/X932W6\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48366107342_cc00f4b651_b.jpg\"\n         alt=\"Campus Lights 10\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eReplacement for Campus Lights 10 in Emulsive version\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.flickr.com/gp/ss9679/1r5U0L\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48365976091_d2be5d79f1_b.jpg\"\n         alt=\"Campus Lights 24\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eReplacement for Campus Lights 24 in Emulsive version\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe following 3 photos are ones that I took for the project, didn\u0026rsquo;t make it into\nthe final cut but I still wanted to share.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.flickr.com/gp/ss9679/x06ue6\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48365982971_a562428381_b.jpg\"\n         alt=\"Campus Lights Out-take 1\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eCampus Lights Out-take 1\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.flickr.com/gp/ss9679/034t81\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48365984271_ac0d5f5e18_b.jpg\"\n         alt=\"Campus Lights Out-take 2\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eCampus Lights Out-take 2\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.flickr.com/gp/ss9679/278p73\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48366118977_03fa2d6a43_b.jpg\"\n         alt=\"Campus Lights Out-take 3\" loading=\"lazy\" /\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eCampus Lights Out-take 3\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOverall I am very pleased with how the project turned out and with how it was\nreceived. My main goal with projects going forward is to try something longer\nterm, and I hope to revisit the topic of light pollution at some point.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "url": "https://samsm.ch/campus-lights-updates/",
  "published": "2019-07-24T00:00:00Z",
